# Approach to Gram Positive Cocci

- **Medically important G+ cocci:**
  - <u>Cocci in clusters</u> (biochemically catalase +ve) - invariably refers to Staphylococcus species
  - <u>Cocci in chains</u> (biochemically catalase -ve) - refers to streptococcus or enterococcus species

  
